# The PNG OG banner is retired. scripts/gen-og-banner.mjs renders
# scripts/og-banner.svg straight to public/og-banner.webp (WebP only — the PNG
# is an in-memory resvg buffer, never written to disk). Redirect any lingering
# request for the old og-banner.png (cached social-share previews, external
# links) to the current WebP asset instead of serving a stale PNG.
/og-banner.png  /og-banner.webp  301

# The indicator catalogue moved from the docs root (/Indicator-Foo) into the
# Indicators/ subfolder (/Indicators/Indicator-Foo). Keep old bookmarks and
# search-engine results alive with a permanent redirect. Cloudflare matches
# top-to-bottom, first match wins, so the Indicator-Chaining reference guide —
# which stayed at the root — is served (200, no redirect) before the wildcard
# can sweep it into /Indicators/. The new /Indicators/... URLs start with
# "/Indicators", not "/Indicator-", so the wildcard never re-captures them.
/Indicator-Chaining  /Indicator-Chaining  200
/Indicator-*  /Indicators/Indicator-:splat  301
